OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds gather for migrant
OL,4,Aprotests in Gosport
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 400 anti-migrant protesters have
OL,7,Fmarched through Gosport against small
OL,8,Fboat arrivals in the town.
OL,10,FIt comes after migrants from two
OL,11,Fvessels were brought ashore in
OL,12,FHampshire in recent months.
OL,14,FAn estimated 100 people gathered
OL,15,Fseparately for a counter-demonstration,
OL,16,Fwhich organisers said was a Unity
OL,17,Fprotest.
OL,19,FHampshire Police kept the two groups
OL,20,Fapart and said both protests passed
OL,21,Fwithout incident and no arrests were
OL,22,Fmade.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
